@host = http://localhost:3000

### 1. Register (only needed once; a second time gives 409, which is fine)
POST {{host}}/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "test@example.com", "password": "password123", "name": "Test" }

### 2. Login (saves the token automatically)
# @name login
POST {{host}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "test@example.com", "password": "password123" }

###
@token = {{login.response.body.token}}

### 3. Get profile
GET {{host}}/profile
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 4. Update profile (expect 200)
PATCH {{host}}/profile
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "heightCm": 170, "weightKg": 62.5, "birthDate": "2000-05-14" }

### 5. Invalid update (expect 400)
PATCH {{host}}/profile
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "heightCm": 5 }

### 6. Logout (expect 204)
POST {{host}}/auth/logout
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 7. Get profile with the OLD token (expect 401)
GET {{host}}/profile
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}



### Muscle groups
GET {{host}}/exercises/muscle-groups
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### List (first page)
# @name list
GET {{host}}/exercises
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###
@exerciseId = {{list.response.body.items[0].id}}

### List with search
GET {{host}}/exercises?search=curl
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### List by muscle group, small pages
GET {{host}}/exercises?muscleGroup=legs&limit=2&page=2
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Invalid muscle group (expect 400)
GET {{host}}/exercises?muscleGroup=banana
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Detail
GET {{host}}/exercises/{{exerciseId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Add favorite (expect 204)
PUT {{host}}/exercises/{{exerciseId}}/favorite
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Favorites only (should contain just that exercise)
GET {{host}}/exercises?favoritesOnly=true
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Remove favorite (expect 204)
DELETE {{host}}/exercises/{{exerciseId}}/favorite
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Unknown id (expect 404)
GET {{host}}/exercises/doesnotexist
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}